v 3
d Automatic model assumption tests after stcox, streg and nbreg
d The assumptiontest command runs and evaluates model assumption tests after stcox, streg (exponential and Weibull) and nbreg, lists the assumptions that cannot be tested, and returns all results in r(); the estimation results and e(sample) are preserved.
d 
d Program by Barna Szabó-Söderberg
p assumptiontest Model assumption tests after stcox, streg and nbreg.